# Cargo build output. The repo-root .gitignore has no Rust rules; scope them here so
# they cannot leak into the host's Node/artifacts rules.
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock for a library is normally not committed, but this crate carries an exact
# pin (axum = "=0.7.5") and becomes a binary once the serving core lands, so the lock
# is committed deliberately for reproducible builds.
